            "question": "How do I know which Chemistrie products are right for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with our Ritual Finder. Answer a few simple questions about your skin, concerns, and preferences, and we'll recommend a Chemistrie ritual designed to make choosing your skincare straightforward.</p>"
