        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use Chemistrie products with my current skincare products?",
            "answer": "<p>In many cases, yes. How products fit together depends on what you are already using and your individual skin. Follow the directions provided with each Chemistrie product, introduce new products thoughtfully, and contact us at support@chemistrieco.com if you have a question about combining products.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I have sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Everyone's skin is different. Review the ingredient list before use and introduce new skincare products gradually, particularly if you know your skin is sensitive. Discontinue use if significant irritation occurs and consult an appropriate healthcare professional if you have concerns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How quickly will my order ship?",
            "answer": "<p>Shipping options and estimated delivery timing are displayed at checkout. Once your order ships, you'll receive tracking information by email.</p>"
          }
        },
