          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if a product isn't right for me or there is a problem with my order?",
            "answer": "<p>We want you to feel confident in your Chemistrie ritual. If something does not feel right or there is an issue with your order, contact support@chemistrieco.com. Our team will review the situation and work with you on an appropriate resolution, which may include product guidance, replacement, or store credit.</p>"
          }
        },
